flowchart LR
  Client[Browser or API client] -->|Basic authentication| Security[Spring Security]
  Security -->|CSRF token required for unsafe methods| CSRF[CSRF filter]
  CSRF --> Actor[ActorFactory: authenticated principal and roles]
  Actor --> AuthZ[Ownership and role checks]
  AuthZ --> API[Claim REST controller]
  API --> Limit[JSON size and DTO validation]
  Limit --> Service[Transactional use cases]
  Service --> Runtime[Restricted PostgreSQL runtime role]
  Audit[Append-only audit records] -.never stores secrets or claim document payloads.-> Runtime
